1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,780
Ten Korean news stories in under three minutes. Facts first, then both sides.

2
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:20,620
The KOSPI fell 3.48% to close at 5,730.74, as foreign investors net sold 1.62 trillion won in the spot market.

3
00:00:20,620 --> 00:00:34,130
PRO: Retail and institutions cushioned it; foreigners bought futures. CON: Foreign spot selling led the drop; KOSDAQ fell 3.83%.

4
00:00:34,130 --> 00:00:49,220
If the law is amended, setting severance pay aside outside the company will be phased in from 2028, starting with firms of 100 or more employees.

5
00:00:49,220 --> 00:01:00,130
INTENT: Aims to prevent unpaid severance. CAUTION: Fund-type plans pass gains and losses to members.

6
00:01:00,130 --> 00:01:11,780
Seoul's 2027 budget proposal totals 55.7445 trillion won, including 26.6 billion won for a youth AI program.

7
00:01:11,780 --> 00:01:21,950
PRO: Aims to narrow the AI skills gap. CON: A similar extra budget was fully cut last month.

8
00:01:21,950 --> 00:01:35,000
A budget plan cuts dedicated crime-prevention patrol staff from 2,338 to 1,051, while a new patrol corps was also reported.

9
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:45,080
PRO: Shifts policing toward prevention. CON: Doubts over impact amid staff and budget cuts.

10
00:01:45,080 --> 00:01:56,090
Samsung beat Kia 6-4 and is one win from the Korean Series. Game 4 was set for October 30 in Gwangju.

11
00:01:56,090 --> 00:02:06,260
PRO: Samsung: one win away, steady closer. CON: Kia: rallied to 4-4, lineup still dangerous.

12
00:02:06,260 --> 00:02:20,600
Korea Hydro & Nuclear Power ended construction-contract talks for the Czech Dukovany plant. The sticking point was how costs are settled.

13
00:02:20,600 --> 00:02:33,000
From January to September, housing starts in the capital region totaled 96,047 units, or 35.8% of the annual target.

14
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:45,300
The monthly-rent share of Seoul apartment leases rose to 52.7%, up 8.3 percentage points from 44.4% a year earlier.

15
00:02:45,300 --> 00:02:55,010
